{"root":"sudah","ipa":"/su.dah/","core":"表示动作已经完成、状态已经改变或事情已经发生，相当于“已经”、“曾经”。","pos":["虚词"],"scenes":["高频","生活","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/su.dah/","zh":"已经，曾经","phrases":[{"t":"sudah makan","zh":"已经吃过饭了"},{"t":"sudah lama","zh":"很久以前"},{"t":"sudah tentu","zh":"当然，确定"}],"examples":[{"t":"Saya sudah menyelesaikan tugas itu.","zh":"我已经完成了那项任务。"},{"t":"Apakah kamu sudah siap?","zh":"你准备好了吗？"}]},"ders":[{"w":"sudah","ipa":"/su.dah/","zh":"已经","phrase":{"t":"sudah selesai","zh":"已经结束"},"example":{"t":"Dia sudah pergi.","zh":"他已经走了。"}},{"w":"sesudah","ipa":"/sə.su.dah/","zh":"在...之后","phrase":{"t":"sesudah makan","zh":"饭后"},"example":{"t":"Sesudah acara selesai, kami pulang.","zh":"活动结束后，我们回家了。"}},{"w":"sesudahnya","ipa":"/sə.su.dah.ɲa/","zh":"此后，后来","phrase":{"t":"dan sesudahnya","zh":"以及此后"},"example":{"t":"Dia pergi dan sesudahnya tidak kembali.","zh":"他走了，此后就没再回来。"}}],"derSlugs":["sudah","sesudah","sesudahnya"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:13:03.048Z","src":"base"}